---
import AppLayout from '../layouts/AppLayout.astro';
---

<AppLayout title="About Us | OnLoop Energy - Commercial & MSME Renewable EPC" description="OnLoop Energy is an engineering-first renewable EPC firm based in Ahmedabad, Gujarat. We build captive wind and hybrid plants exclusively for C&I and MSME factories.">
<div>

    {/* Hero Section */}
    <section class="hero hero--short hero--image" style="background-image: url('/images/stock/solar-park-1288842.webp');">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="hero__content">
                <div class="hero__badge">
                    <span class="hero__badge-dot"></span>
                    Why OnLoop Energy
                </div>
                <h1 class="hero__title">
                    We start with reality.
                </h1>
                <p class="hero__subtitle">OnLoop Energy is an engineering EPC firm built exclusively for C&I and MSMEs. We don't bid for government tenders. We don't do residential. We solve one problem: your factory's power bill.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    {/* Explicit Exclusion Statement Trust Banner */}
    <div style="background: rgba(31, 183, 166, 0.08); border-top: 1px solid rgba(31, 183, 166, 0.2); border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(31, 183, 166, 0.2); padding: var(--space-4) 0;">
        <div class="container" style="text-align: center;">
            <p style="margin: 0; font-weight: 600; font-size: var(--font-size-base); color: var(--color-text-primary);">
                <strong>Exclusively Private B2B:</strong> Commercial, Industrial & MSME only. No residential. No government.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>

    {/* Company Scale & Positioning Statement */}
    <section class="content-section fade-in" style="padding: var(--space-8) 0; background-color: var(--color-bg-secondary);">
        <div class="container">
            <div style="max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: left; border-left: 4px solid var(--color-primary); padding-left: var(--space-6);">
                <div style="display: flex; gap: var(--space-4); flex-wrap: wrap; margin-bottom: var(--space-4);">
                    <span style="background: #ffffff; padding: 6px 14px; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: 600; font-size: 13px; border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.08);">Based in Ahmedabad, Gujarat</span>
                    <span style="background: #ffffff; padding: 6px 14px; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: 600; font-size: 13px; border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.08);">20+ Captive Plants Delivered</span>
                    <span style="background: #ffffff; padding: 6px 14px; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: 600; font-size: 13px; border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.08);">Serving Textile, Ceramics, Chemical & Food</span>
                </div>
                <p style="font-size: var(--font-size-base); line-height: 1.6; margin: 0; font-weight: 500; color: var(--color-text-primary);">
                    "We are not a trading company. We don't bid for megaprojects or government tenders. We are an engineering house built specifically to solve the energy cost headache of private businesses, MSMEs, and manufacturers."
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    {/* Ideal Partners / Who This Works Best For */}
    <section class="content-section content-section--light fade-in">
        <div class="container container--narrow">
            <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: var(--space-8);">
                <span class="content-section__label">Our Ideal Partners</span>
                <h2 class="content-section__title">Who This Works Best For</h2>
                <p class="content-section__text">OnLoop Energy is built for business owners who want technical clarity, not aggressive selling.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="card" style="padding: var(--space-8); margin-bottom: var(--space-8); background: #ffffff;">
                <h3 style="margin-bottom: var(--space-4); color: var(--color-primary);">One principle guides every decision we make</h3>
                <p class="content-section__text" style="font-size: var(--font-size-lg); font-weight: 500; color: var(--color-text-primary);">
                    If a solution does not genuinely serve your long-term financial interest, we don't push it. If your site wind data doesn't justify a turbine, we tell you up-front — even if it costs us a sale.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    {/* The Engineering Team Behind OnLoop */}
    <section class="content-section fade-in" style="background: #ffffff;">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="content-section__header">
                <span class="content-section__label">Leadership & Expertise</span>
                <h2 class="content-section__title">The Engineering Team Behind OnLoop</h2>
                <p class="content-section__text">In B2B sales, engineering capability matters. Our team combines site wind assessment expertise, electrical protection engineering, and turnkey industrial EPC execution.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="grid-3" style="gap: var(--space-6);">
                <div class="card" style="padding: var(--space-6); background: var(--color-bg-light); border-top: 3px solid var(--color-primary);">
                    <h4 class="card__title" style="margin-bottom: 2px;">Engineering Leadership</h4>
                    <span style="font-size: 12px; color: var(--color-primary); font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase;">Technical Operations & Design</span>
                    <p class="card__text" style="font-size: 14px; margin-top: 10px; color: var(--color-text-secondary);">
                        Led by experienced renewable power engineers specializing in direct-drive Permanent Magnet Alternator (PMA) wind systems and industrial load profile modeling.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="card" style="padding: var(--space-6); background: var(--color-bg-light); border-top: 3px solid var(--color-primary);">
                    <h4 class="card__title" style="margin-bottom: 2px;">Wind Resource Assessment</h4>
                    <span style="font-size: 12px; color: var(--color-primary); font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase;">Hub-Height Site Analytics</span>
                    <p class="card__text" style="font-size: 14px; margin-top: 10px; color: var(--color-text-secondary);">
                        Dedicated wind data analysts evaluating anemometer readings, micro-climate terrain shifts, and hub-height wind velocities across Gujarat's industrial corridors.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="card" style="padding: var(--space-6); background: var(--color-bg-light); border-top: 3px solid var(--color-primary);">
                    <h4 class="card__title" style="margin-bottom: 2px;">Turnkey Project Execution</h4>
                    <span style="font-size: 12px; color: var(--color-primary); font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase;">Civil, Electrical & Statutory</span>
                    <p class="card__text" style="font-size: 14px; margin-top: 10px; color: var(--color-text-secondary);">
                        Field execution teams managing structural foundations, grid coordination, electrical protection relays, and long-term 20-year O&M performance monitoring.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    {/* Technology Architecture */}
    <section class="content-section content-section--light fade-in">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="content-section__header">
                <span class="content-section__label">Technology Focus</span>
                <h2 class="content-section__title">Wind-First. Hybrid-Optimized.</h2>
                <p class="content-section__text">We engineer wind-first and hybrid captive energy systems that work when your factory runs.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="grid-2">
                <div class="card" style="padding: var(--space-8); background: #ffffff;">
                    <div class="card__icon">
                        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
                            <path d="M9.59 4.59A2 2 0 1 1 11 8H2m10.59 11.41A2 2 0 1 0 14 16H2m15.73-8.27A2.5 2.5 0 1 1 19.5 12H2" />
                        </svg>
                    </div>
                    <h4 class="card__title">Wind-First Engineering</h4>
                    <p class="card__text">
                        We deploy wind turbines where site data supports long-term performance. Wind provides 24/7 power — evenings, night shifts, and monsoons when solar output is zero.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="card" style="padding: var(--space-8); background: #ffffff;">
                    <div class="card__icon">
                        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
                            <path d="M12 2L2 7l10 5 10-5-10-5z" />
                            <path d="M2 17l10 5 10-5" />
                            <path d="M2 12l10 5 10-5" />
                        </svg>
                    </div>
                    <h4 class="card__title">Hybrid-Optimized Architecture</h4>
                    <p class="card__text">
                        We add solar only when it complements wind. We never recommend pure solar alone — solar cannot run a multi-shift factory.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    {/* Bottom CTA */}
    <section class="cta-section fade-in">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="cta-section__content">
                <h2 class="cta-section__title">Ready to see what wind + hybrid can do for your factory?</h2>
                <p class="cta-section__text">Share your electricity bill. We'll return a wind & hybrid feasibility report — free, no obligation.</p>
                <a href="/contact" class="btn btn--primary btn--large">
                    Get Your Free Feasibility Study
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" width="20" height="20">
                        <line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12" />
                        <polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19" />
                    </svg>
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

</div>
</AppLayout>
